WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.263
Sit tall, back on the pad, arms out wide with elbows almost straight.

2
00:00:02.263 --> 00:00:04.527
Sweep your straight arms forward until your hands meet in front of you.

3
00:00:04.527 --> 00:00:06.790
Open your arms slowly back out to a full chest stretch.
